=== intro

A well-dressed figure intercepts you on the concourse. Guild insignia on their collar.

"Captain. The Free Traders Guild has noticed your work. We appreciate independent operators who deliver on time and ask the right questions—which is to say, none at all.

"Consider this a gesture of goodwill."

They hand you a credit chip.

* [Accept graciously]
  ~ credits += 40
  ~ chronicle "Guild Notice"
    The Free Traders Guild has taken an interest in our work. Their credits spend the same as anyone's.
  -> END

* [Decline—no strings attached]
  ~ morale += 5
  ~ chronicle "Independence"
    Refused a guild gift. We answer to no one but ourselves.
  -> END
